OL,3,ACars torched and shops looted as
OL,4,Aanti-migrant violence erupts in South
OL,5,AAfrica
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe violence comes amid growing anger
OL,8,Fover a court ruling requiring the
OL,9,Fgovernment to remove barriers that had
OL,10,Fprevented some migrants from applying
OL,11,Ffor asylum.
OL,13,FSouth Africa has experienced repeated
OL,14,Foutbreaks of xenophobic violence, often
OL,15,Ftargeting migrants from neighbouring
OL,16,Fcountries.
